</div> <span class="font-body text-[18px] lg:text-[20px] text-white" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> Enable seamless collaboration </span> </div> </div> <a href="/company-directory" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border border-white rounded-[8px] px-7 py-3.5 font-body font-bold text-[18px] lg:text-[20px] text-white whitespace-nowrap hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
Explore our companies
</a> </div> <!-- Right: Einstein image + quote --> <div class="einstein-panel relative z-10 w-full max-w-[420px] mx-auto aspect-[600/774] lg:w-[494px] lg:max-w-none lg:aspect-auto lg:h-[637px] lg:mx-0 shrink-0 lg:-mt-[60px]" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/images/einstein.webp" alt="Albert Einstein" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover pointer-events-none" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <blockquote class="absolute bottom-8 right-4 max-w-[191px]" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="font-quote text-[15px] lg:text-[17px] text-white leading-normal" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
"Everything should be as simple as it can be, but not simpler."
</p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="bg-white w-full py-8 lg:py-0 fade-in" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="max-w-[1600px] mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:min-h-[480px] lg:items-center" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <!-- Left: image --> <div class="shrink-0 lg:w-[475px] h-[320px] lg:h-[495px] border-[7px] border-white overflow-hidden lg:self-start lg:-mt-[19px]" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/images/next-leap.webp" alt="Vantage Labs team exploring next-generation intelligent systems" class="w-full h-full object-cover" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </div> <!-- Right: copy --> <div class="flex-1 px-8 py-8 lg:py-0 lg:pl-16" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h2 class="font-heading text-[36px] lg:text-[45px] leading-tight text-vantage-body mb-6" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
The Next Leap Forward
</h2> <div class="font-body text-[18px] lg:text-[20px] text-vantage-body leading-relaxed space-y-5 max-w-none" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
Steeped in the technological shifts that have reshaped history,
              we're building what comes next:  <strong class="font-bold" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>intelligent systems that collaborate with us, learn alongside
                us, and help us move faster, smarter.</strong> </p> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
We call them the Pantheon of Agents and they're already making a
              difference across our companies.
</p> </div> <div class="mt-8 hidden" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border border-vantage-purple rounded-[8px] px-7 py-3.5 font-body font-bold text-[18px] lg:text-[20px] text-vantage-purple whitespace-nowrap hover:bg-purple-50 transition-colors" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
Discover what's new
</a> </div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="relative z-10 bg-white w-full py-8 lg:py-0 fade-in" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="max-w-[1600px] mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:min-h-[480px] lg:items-center" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <!-- Left: copy --> <div class="flex-1 px-8 py-8 lg:py-0" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h2 class="font-heading text-[36px] lg:text-[45px] leading-tight text-vantage-body mb-4" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
Let's Build Together
</h2> <p class="font-body text-[18px] lg:text-[20px] text-vantage-body leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-none" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
As we forge new paths in intelligent technology, we welcome those
            who want to make a difference. Be part of a team where invention
            meets execution, and where your impact is real and lasting.
</p> <div class="hidden" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border border-vantage-purple rounded-[8px] px-7 py-3.5 font-body font-bold text-[18px] lg:text-[20px] text-vantage-purple whitespace-nowrap hover:bg-purple-50 transition-colors" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
Start your journey with us
</a> </div> </div> <!-- Right: image --> <div class="shrink-0 lg:w-[475px] h-[320px] lg:h-[495px] border-[7px] border-white overflow-hidden lg:self-end lg:translate-y-[40px]" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/images/lets-build-together.webp" alt="Vantage Labs team members collaborating on technology innovation" class="w-full h-full object-cover" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="bg-section-purple w-full fade-in" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="max-w-[1600px] mx-auto px-8 py-20 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-12" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <!-- Icon --> <div class="shrink-0" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="logo-icon-wrap logo-icon-wrap--white relative inline-flex" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/images/icon.power-i.svg" alt="Vantage Labs — advancing AI and cognitive science" class="w-56 lg:w-72 h-auto relative z-10" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </span> </div> <!-- Text --> <div class="flex-1" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="font-body font-bold text-[24px] lg:text-[33px] text-white leading-relaxed" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
We're committed to advancing artificial intelligence and cognitive
            science research across education, commerce, and
            government—improving how people communicate, learn, and live.
</p> </div> </div> </section> <script type="module">function r(e){requestAnimationFrame(()=>{requestAnimationFrame(()=>{e.classList.add("is-visible")})})}const i=new IntersectionObserver((e,s)=>{e.forEach(t=>{t.isIntersecting&&(r(t.target),s.unobserve(t.target))})},{threshold:.1});document.querySelectorAll(".fade-in").forEach(e=>{e.classList.contains("fade-after-hero")&&e.getBoundingClientRect().top<window.innerHeight?setTimeout(()=>r(e),1350):i.observe(e)});</script>  <footer class="bg-footer w-full"> <div class="max-w-[1600px] mx-auto px-8 py-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8"> <!-- Logo (white version) --> <a href="/" class="flex items-center shrink-0"> <img src="/images/logo-white.svg" alt="Vantage Labs" class="h-[52px] w-auto"> </a> <!-- Links --> <nav class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-6"> <a href="/privacy-policy" class="font-footer text-[19px] lg:text-[21px] text-white hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a> <a href="#" data-contact-trigger class="font-footer text-[19px] lg:text-[21px] text-white hover:underline">Contact Us</a> </nav> </div> </footer> <div id="contact-modal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-[100] items-center justify-center px-4" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-nxxydibx> <div id="contact-modal-overlay" class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/60" data-astro-cid-nxxydibx></div> <div class="relative bg-white w-full max-w-[640px] max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto rounded-2xl shadow-[0_20px_60px_-10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)] p-8 lg:p-10" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="contact-modal-title" data-astro-cid-nxxydibx> <button id="contact-modal-close" type="button" aria-label="Close" class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-black/50 hover:text-black transition-colors p-2" data-astro-cid-nxxydibx> <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" data-astro-cid-nxxydibx> <line x1="4" y1="4" x2="16" y2="16" data-astro-cid-nxxydibx></line> <line x1="1